>> title: Barbecue Sauce
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: tomato, smoky, grilling, pork, stovetop
>> counters: Smokehouse
>> aka: bbq sauce, barbeque sauce, sweet sauce
>> pairs-with: memphis-dry-rub
>> servings: 12
>> time: 45 min
>> step.1: sweat 6 min
>> step.2: toast 1 min
>> step.3: simmer 25 min
>> step.4: season

Sweat @yellow onion{1/2%cup}(minced) and @garlic{3%cloves}(minced) in @unsalted butter{2%Tbs} over medium heat for ~{6%min}.

Toast @smoked paprika{1%Tbs}, @dry mustard{1%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/2%tsp} in @&(~1)aromatics{} for ~{1%min}.

Simmer @&(~1)spice base{} with @tomato ketchup{1 1/2%cups}(400 g), @cider vinegar{1/3%cup}(80 mL), @dark brown sugar{1/3%cup}(70 g), @molasses{2%Tbs}, and @Worcestershire sauce{1%Tbs} for ~{25%min}.

Season @&(~1)sauce{} with @kosher salt{1%tsp}.
